like thirty seven cents a
minute.

04:41.000 --> 04:44.000
Then again a mobile phone in
Belgium is cheaper.

04:44.000 --> 04:48.000
So there's all different rates
going on in the mobile industry
for sure.

04:48.000 --> 04:53.000
But again that's all I'm looking
for a voice over IP provider
that can give me that and

04:53.000 --> 05:01.000
